        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jun 23, 2023 | Julie Andreyev, Simon Lysander Overstall, Giorgio Magnanensi, Lara Felsing, M. Simon Levin, Emma Pallay, Keira Madsen, Myles V Feltenberger | Branching Songs is an ongoing collaborative project that draws attention to trees and forests in the West Coast region."
