    ],
    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Branching Songs in Grey Creek Forest. The bases of large cedar tree trunks are pictured with flat, wooden panels - Sitka spruce resonators. Stiched together fabric in white and red that resembles a quick is strung up between two tree trunks. Sword ferns grown on the forest floor between the trees."
      }
