        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Spring Soundwalks: Prog-Walk — Vancouver New Music"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "May 21, 2023 | Helena Krobath | This soundwalk structures the Olympic Village area of False Creek into a series of ambient listening stages. Each stage will include an optional prompt for imaginative ways the space can be heard."
      }
    ],
