    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Two photographs side by side. On the left is an image of a colourful mural featuring lush ferns, and people standing, and sitting at a table. A nude female figure sits crouched on the ground and a white bird flies near her head. On the right is a grey, stone planter with a face carved into it. The features are simple and not detailed. It holds purple and yellow flowers."
      }
