        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Time Flows... And A Symphony — Vancouver New Music"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jun 01, 2022 | Hye-Soon Seo | The work plays notes and sounds found in two specific places – MMCA Residency Goyang where I stay at the moment, and Newcastle University where I have never been, so for me it is an imaginary place."
      }
