    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "May 07, 2022 | Julie Andreyev, Simon Lysander Overstall, Anju Singh, Stefan Smulovitz, Martin Reisle, Adrian Avendaño, Giorgio Magnanensi | EPIC_Tom ++ explores multispecies collaboration through sound and image, bringing together dogs, crows, and forest communities in a creative dialogue."
