        "@value": "Feb 23, 2021 |  | Join guitarist Adrian Verdejo, along with composers Wolf Edwards (Victoria), Peter Hannan (Vancouver), Diego Lozano Verduzco (Mexico) and Rodney Sharman (Vancouver) in conversation with VNM Artistsic Director Giorgio Magnanensi."
